I made myself vulnerable recently, and I was not harmed. It felt like nobody wanted me there, wherever I go. Does that mean democracy is working? I am being unfair. Someday, all the words I've written will be cast in the most isolating light. I forgive my past self for this future shame, both his/her and me always knew that would happen. I hope my future self can bear it, whether or not forgiveness is given the weight is much to bear. The tunnel under the crushing mountain is held up by pillars of wood. They splinter over time and must be replaced. May one day the mountain be hollowed.